<title>USA: Angeles Mortgage trust restructures loan.</title>
<headline>Angeles Mortgage trust restructures loan.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Angeles Mortgage Investment Trust said its restructured its largest loan.</p>
<p>The restructuring results in a net book value of the Trust of over $15 per share, up seven percent, or over $1 per share, and in an increase of annual cash flow from the Trust's investments of about $400,000, which will augment funds available for distribution to shareholders.</p>
</text>
